So speakest thou not, and I shall giveth mine own.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.790
My body, forged of steel. My brains, flowing electrons.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.880
Tormenting crying children into silence, 
and silent children into tears.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:37.510
Jet Jaguar takes the stage!

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:40.220
This is the end of the line for you!

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.720
Yun, take the kid and run! Bolt outta here!

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.520
I challenge thee to a due—

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.190
Don't cut me off! Pipe down and wait your turn!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:56.780
Ah—wait, wait, wait!

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.280
Ye bastard!

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.870
The hell ya think yer doing!?

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:09.120
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:13.040
Quite the rough visitor you are, milady!

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.710
My arm!

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:23.720
Should my limbs be torn asunder 
and my head severed, I march on!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.700
What do ya think yer doing!?

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.370
How dare you lay your wings on...

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.710
my precious Jet Jaguar!

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:56.290
No octopus can stand to have its legs torn off!

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:06.350
Ouch.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.680
I beesech your aid O Great God of Arms, Henjo Kongo!

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.600
Power, energy, harmony, healing! 
Let this be a dream, let this be a dream!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.770
In a field of mulberries, I awaken!

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.030
That you, Yun!?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.040
Hand that over! This is out of your league!

